{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Pasture is your charming little farm simulator that cozies up at the bottom of your screen, keeping you company while you work or study. In this game, you can buy adorable baby animals, grow them, and collect coins dropped from them once they\u2019re all grown up to rake in some sweet profits and expand your pasture. When you improve yourself and have fun, your little critters will grow with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits, foxes, alpacas, birds... and even slimes and zombies? Before long, you'll have an entire animal army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/ed754849cee70c65bb5ea97393f093a4.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/ed754849cee70c65bb5ea97393f093a4.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/ed754849cee70c65bb5ea97393f093a4.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Interactive with Your Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, click on them, and watch them grow happily! You can also click on them with the middle mouse button to make them follow your cursor around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1eae2274a364cb348441bd31da4dda4c.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1eae2274a364cb348441bd31da4dda4c.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1eae2274a364cb348441bd31da4dda4c.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise a New Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the Mystery Curtain in the Pasture and choose two adult animals of the same species. After a while, they'll breed and bring forth newborn animals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/e99e67abb384259a48c0b5edd70536d1.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/e99e67abb384259a48c0b5edd70536d1.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/e99e67abb384259a48c0b5edd70536d1.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic Pasture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and deploy magical facilities to help you keep your animals clean and healthy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1c4bf520b74e4d22a09bc82c9fcc4d99.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1c4bf520b74e4d22a09bc82c9fcc4d99.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1c4bf520b74e4d22a09bc82c9fcc4d99.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely drag and adjust the length of the pasture. Place it anywhere on your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/7456233097149ae6838c7d2dc8157d8c.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/7456233097149ae6838c7d2dc8157d8c.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/7456233097149ae6838c7d2dc8157d8c.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd8a\ufe0fGame FAQ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>I usually hide my taskbar, but after running the game, it's gone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Just press the Win key on your keyboard after running the game, and the taskbar will reappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>Why is the background behind my animals black when I open the game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Please click on &quot;View Discussions&quot; on the store page; we've pinned a solution for the black screen issue there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>Whenever Steam pops up a notification, the Pasture screen tears!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> You can go to your library, right-click on our game, go to properties, general, and turn off &quot;Enable Steam Overlay while in-game&quot;. This option will only affect our game and won't impact other games!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice Pasture Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/7f2abd7f2ac3e39e3b6c5eca7533022e38235c98.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner Pasture Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/8f4bd77869323b32daa51e188be11c12fd559db5.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Pasture Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/bd002f353687dc05d283d28d203230b4fde2968f.jpg"},{"name":"Super Pasture Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/d35a7885f72987f02964fc6758345e59c7e51ae2.jpg"},{"name":"Take Precious Good Care","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/5bbcd491e8855ceefba683658a6bb2350b4df85f.jpg"},{"name":"Encyclopedia Enthusiast: Rabbit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/5f1d616014dc4ea7a808eb79b6b895def33c5ddb.jpg"},{"name":"Encyclopedia Enthusiast: Alpaca","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/2a8c8082711866f1494c752ce852cd908abd479e.jpg"},{"name":"Encyclopedia Enthusiast: Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/f7d17fa913f251394e37583011fce3dabf466e14.jpg"},{"name":"Encyclopedia Enthusiast: Parrot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/91ac6227612b47c4b091467b81b6824e4fe61f86.jpg"},{"name":"Encyclopedia Enthusiast: Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167550/dd9ff7f9f39a1a0e5c698efb03a4a1d5108a562c.jpg"}],"total":55},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3167550?t=1773391982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773391982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/2f6c7e85bcc108efead4eb9f7e1ae0b029111fe9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773391982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/2f6c7e85bcc108efead4eb9f7e1ae0b029111fe9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773391982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83d\udce2UPDATES &amp; ANNOUNCEMENTS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna know about our development progress or future updates? Join our community and chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/df58138326f948e3fe1c0ea95222478a.avif?t=1773391982\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got issues like black screens, crashes, display problems, or save errors? Check the discussions for solutions. Thanks for all your support!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Pasture is your charming little farm simulator that cozies up at the bottom of your screen, keeping you company while you work or study. In this game, you can buy adorable baby animals, grow them, and collect coins dropped from them once they\u2019re all grown up to rake in some sweet profits and expand your pasture. When you improve yourself and have fun, your little critters will grow with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits, foxes, alpacas, birds... and even slimes and zombies? Before long, you'll have an entire animal army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/ed754849cee70c65bb5ea97393f093a4.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/ed754849cee70c65bb5ea97393f093a4.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/ed754849cee70c65bb5ea97393f093a4.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Interactive with Your Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, click on them, and watch them grow happily! You can also click on them with the middle mouse button to make them follow your cursor around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1eae2274a364cb348441bd31da4dda4c.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1eae2274a364cb348441bd31da4dda4c.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1eae2274a364cb348441bd31da4dda4c.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise a New Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the Mystery Curtain in the Pasture and choose two adult animals of the same species. After a while, they'll breed and bring forth newborn animals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/e99e67abb384259a48c0b5edd70536d1.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/e99e67abb384259a48c0b5edd70536d1.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/e99e67abb384259a48c0b5edd70536d1.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic Pasture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and deploy magical facilities to help you keep your animals clean and healthy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1c4bf520b74e4d22a09bc82c9fcc4d99.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=650 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1c4bf520b74e4d22a09bc82c9fcc4d99.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/1c4bf520b74e4d22a09bc82c9fcc4d99.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely drag and adjust the length of the pasture. Place it anywhere on your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/7456233097149ae6838c7d2dc8157d8c.poster.avif?t=1773391982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/7456233097149ae6838c7d2dc8157d8c.webm?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/extras/7456233097149ae6838c7d2dc8157d8c.mp4?t=1773391982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd8a\ufe0fGame FAQ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>I usually hide my taskbar, but after running the game, it's gone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Just press the Win key on your keyboard after running the game, and the taskbar will reappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>Why is the background behind my animals black when I open the game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Please click on &quot;View Discussions&quot; on the store page; we've pinned a solution for the black screen issue there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>Whenever Steam pops up a notification, the Pasture screen tears!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> You can go to your library, right-click on our game, go to properties, general, and turn off &quot;Enable Steam Overlay while in-game&quot;. This option will only affect our game and won't impact other games!</p>","developers":["CaveLiquid"],"dlc":[3734130,3592330,3467780,3687640],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167550/header.jpg?t=1773391982","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3167550/338372072/7813e5ddaf6378eb3f73b15256d7bef57a86864d/1770876089/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770878527","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3167550/338372072/7813e5ddaf6378eb3f73b15256d7bef57a86864d/1770876089/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770878527","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam